      &\approx _{1/q} \E_{x,z,\alpha,\beta} \sum_{g_\xpt, g_\zpt}\bra{\hat{\psi}}  (\hat{S}_{g_\xpt,g_\zpt})_{\alice \alice'} \otimes \Big ( \sum_{b,b'} 1_{\alpha b + \beta b' = \alpha g_\xpt (x) + \beta g_\zpt(z) } \cdot \,\notag\\
