  = E^{\Variable_1,\, \omega}_{a_{\overline{w}}} \otimes I,
  \end{equation*}
  where the last step is by Theorem~\ref{thm:ms-from-ac}.
  As these measurements are consistent, this test is passed with
  probability~$1$.
